SUMMARY:Mars Hill CrossFit Club
DESCRIPTION:Open to students\, staff\, and faculty. We meet every Monday\, Wednesday\, and Friday at 6:30am at X-Caliber CrossFit in Weaverville. No need to be scared or intimidated\, EVERYTHING is modifiable and we have a lot of fun and share tons of laughter. CrossFit is more about community and building one another up through fitness and fellowship than anything else. If you have concerns or questions please reach out to Dr. Natalie Boone. If you are interested in trying it out\, just show up at 6:30 MWF ready to go.  Come on out and join the fun with us. (If you want to see some of the fun we have been having follow us on instagram at marshill_crossfit).
